# `gruntas status` with no config: the two implicit accounts, Claude Code and
# Codex, none ready (no login, no claude or codex on this PATH), exit 3 with
# the rows as the failure's details; then a key in the environment, which is
# no account by itself (D4: gruntas runs no model itself), so still exit 3.
# The `--json` rows are the documented shape: every key on every row. The
# key is a sentinel that must appear nowhere below.
gruntas status
gruntas status --json
@env ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-golden-SENTINEL-do-not-print
gruntas status --json
gruntas status --format human
gruntas providers list --format human
